config.trickytrialsbackport.tuff.tooltip=1.21's tuff stairs, slabs and walls, polished tuff, tuff bricks and the chiseled forms.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tuff.enabled.tooltip=The tuff blocks. Off, nothing is registered, and a world that has them loses them.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tuff.generate.tooltip=Without another installed mod that adds tuff, tuff generates in stone below y 16 in newly generated chunks, as in 1.17.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.tooltip=Copper bulbs, doors, trapdoors, grates and chiseled copper, with their oxidation and waxing.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.enabled.tooltip=The copper blocks. Off, nothing is registered, and a world that has them loses them.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.oxidation.tooltip=Unwaxed copper blocks slowly oxidize: exposed, weathered, then oxidized.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.waxItems.tooltip=Items that wax copper when used on it or crafted with it (registry names). Any item with the ore name honeycomb works too.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.generate.tooltip=Without another installed mod that adds copper, copper ore generates in newly generated chunks, as in 1.17.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.veinsPerChunk.tooltip=Copper ore veins per chunk.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.veinSize.tooltip=Blocks of copper ore per vein, at most.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.minY.tooltip=Lowest height of a copper ore vein.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copper.maxY.tooltip=Highest height of a copper ore vein.
config.trickytrialsbackport.breeze.tooltip=The breeze, breeze rods and wind charges.
config.trickytrialsbackport.breeze.enabled.tooltip=The breeze, the breeze rod and the wind charge. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.bogged.tooltip=The bogged, the skeleton of swamps.
config.trickytrialsbackport.bogged.enabled.tooltip=The bogged. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.bogged.spawn.tooltip=Bogged spawn in swamps and mangrove swamps, and take 30 of the 100 skeleton spawns there, as in 1.21.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mace.tooltip=The mace, the heavy core, and Density, Breach and Wind Burst.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mace.enabled.tooltip=The mace, the heavy core and the mace's three enchantments. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.crafter.tooltip=The crafter.
config.trickytrialsbackport.crafter.enabled.tooltip=The crafter. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.trials.tooltip=Trial spawners, vaults, trial keys, ominous trials and Trial Omen.
config.trickytrialsbackport.trials.enabled.tooltip=Trial spawners, vaults, both trial keys and Trial Omen. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.effects.tooltip=Weaving, Oozing, Infested and Wind Charged, and their potions and arrows.
config.trickytrialsbackport.effects.enabled.tooltip=The four effects and their potions. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.decor.tooltip=New paintings, banner patterns, music discs, pottery sherds and armor trim templates.
config.trickytrialsbackport.decor.enabled.tooltip=Paintings, banner patterns, music discs, sherds and trim templates. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.chambers.tooltip=Trial chambers.
config.trickytrialsbackport.chambers.enabled.tooltip=Trial chambers generate underground in newly generated chunks.
config.trickytrialsbackport.bundles.tooltip=Bundles and the sixteen dyed bundles.
config.trickytrialsbackport.bundles.enabled.tooltip=Bundles. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.paleGarden.tooltip=The pale garden: pale oak, pale moss, hanging moss, eyeblossoms, the creaking heart and the biome.
config.trickytrialsbackport.paleGarden.enabled.tooltip=The pale garden's blocks and items. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.paleGarden.generateBiome.tooltip=Part of every roofed forest becomes a pale garden, in newly generated chunks, as 1.21.4 put the pale garden in the dark forest's climate.
config.trickytrialsbackport.creaking.tooltip=The creaking.
config.trickytrialsbackport.creaking.enabled.tooltip=The creaking. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.resin.tooltip=Resin clumps, resin blocks and resin bricks.
config.trickytrialsbackport.resin.enabled.tooltip=The resin blocks and items. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.flora.tooltip=Spring's plants: bushes, firefly bushes, cactus flowers, dry grass, leaf litter, wildflowers and fallen trees.
config.trickytrialsbackport.flora.enabled.tooltip=The new plants. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.tooltip=Warm and cold cows, pigs and chickens, blue and brown eggs, and wolf sound variants.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.enabled.tooltip=The farm animal variants and the two eggs. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.cowVariants.tooltip=Cows spawn warm or cold by biome, with 1.21.5's cow models and textures. Off, every cow stays as 1.12.2 draws it.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.pigVariants.tooltip=Pigs spawn warm or cold by biome, with 1.21.5's pig models and textures. Off, every pig stays as 1.12.2 draws it.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.chickenVariants.tooltip=Chickens spawn warm or cold by biome, with 1.21.5's chicken models and textures. Off, every chicken stays as 1.12.2 draws it.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.coloredEggs.tooltip=Blue and brown eggs: cold chickens lay blue eggs and warm chickens brown ones, which hatch chicks of that kind and bake into cakes and pumpkin pies. Off, the eggs are not registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.sheepColors.tooltip=Sheep in warm biomes are mostly brown and in cold biomes mostly black, as in 1.21.5. Off, sheep spawn mostly white everywhere.
config.trickytrialsbackport.animals.wolfSoundVariants.tooltip=Each wolf gets one of 1.21.5's seven voices (classic, puglin, sad, angry, grumpy, big, cute). Off, every wolf sounds as in 1.12.2.
config.trickytrialsbackport.happyGhast.tooltip=The happy ghast, ghastlings, the dried ghast and harnesses.
config.trickytrialsbackport.happyGhast.enabled.tooltip=The happy ghast, the dried ghast and harnesses. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.happyGhast.riderCameraDistance.tooltip=While riding a happy ghast, the third-person camera stays 8 blocks back instead of 4.
config.trickytrialsbackport.locatorBar.tooltip=The locator bar, which shows other players' directions.
config.trickytrialsbackport.locatorBar.enabled.tooltip=Show the locator bar in place of the experience bar while other players are near.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.tooltip=The copper golem, copper golem statues and copper chests.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.enabled.tooltip=The copper golem, its statue and the copper chest. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.building.tooltip=A carved pumpkin or jack o'lantern placed on a copper block builds a copper golem, and the copper block turns into a copper chest.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.sorting.tooltip=Copper golems carry items from copper chests to chests and trapped chests nearby.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.oxidation.tooltip=Copper golems, copper chests and copper golem statues oxidize over time.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.statues.tooltip=A fully oxidized copper golem sometimes turns into a copper golem statue.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGolem.ironGolemFlowers.tooltip=Iron golems sometimes put a poppy on a copper golem's head.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGear.tooltip=Copper tools, armor and nuggets; copper torches, lanterns, bars and chains.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGear.enabled.tooltip=Copper tools, armor and the other copper items. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGear.mobArmor.tooltip=Zombies, skeletons and their kinds that spawn wearing armor pick it as 1.21.9 does: leather, copper or gold first, then a better tier now and then. Off, 1.12.2's roll (no copper).
config.trickytrialsbackport.copperGear.horseArmorLoot.tooltip=Copper horse armor in the chests that have iron horse armor (dungeons, temples, strongholds, ...).
config.trickytrialsbackport.shelves.tooltip=Wooden shelves.
config.trickytrialsbackport.shelves.enabled.tooltip=Shelves. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.spears.tooltip=Spears and Lunge.
config.trickytrialsbackport.spears.enabled.tooltip=The seven spears and Lunge. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.spears.mobSpears.tooltip=Zombies, husks and zombie villagers that spawn with a weapon sometimes hold an iron spear, and zombie pigmen a golden spear one time in 20, as in 1.21.11. Off, 1.12.2's weapons.
config.trickytrialsbackport.spears.mobCharges.tooltip=Zombies and zombie pigmen holding a spear charge at their target with it, as in 1.21.11.
config.trickytrialsbackport.nautilus.tooltip=The nautilus, the zombie nautilus, nautilus armor and Breath of the Nautilus.
config.trickytrialsbackport.nautilus.enabled.tooltip=The nautilus, its armor and its effect. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.nautilus.naturalSpawn.tooltip=Nautiluses spawn in oceans, 5 to 25 blocks below sea level, as in 1.21.11.
config.trickytrialsbackport.nautilus.drownedRiders.tooltip=With Update Aquatic, half of the drowned that spawn with a trident outside rivers ride a zombie nautilus.
config.trickytrialsbackport.nautilus.chestLoot.tooltip=With Update Aquatic, shipwreck, buried treasure and ocean ruin chests can hold nautilus armor.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.tooltip=The camel husk, the parched, zombie horses in the wild and netherite horse armor.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.enabled.tooltip=The camel husk, the parched and netherite horse armor. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.zombieHorses.tooltip=Zombie horses as in 1.21.11: 25 health, tamed by riding, red mushrooms tempt and heal them, they take a saddle and horse armor, burn in daylight without armor, and despawn while untamed.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.zombieHorseSpawn.tooltip=Zombie horses spawn in plains and savannas in the dark, each ridden by a zombie (with an iron spear when spears exist).
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.parchedSpawn.tooltip=Parched spawn in deserts under the open sky, taking 50 of the 100 skeleton spawns there, as in 1.21.11.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.netheriteHorseArmor.tooltip=Netherite horse armor: 19 armor, 3 toughness, knockback resistance; made from diamond horse armor at a smithing table when a netherite mod is installed.
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.floatWhileRidden.tooltip=Horses, donkeys, mules and camels float up in deep water while ridden instead of sinking (1.21.11).
config.trickytrialsbackport.mounts.mountedReach.tooltip=A zombie riding a mount reaches as far as its mount is wide, as in current versions.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.tooltip=1.21's smaller changes to things 1.12.2 already has.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.enabled.tooltip=1.21's smaller changes to existing blocks, items and mobs.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.ridersThroughPortals.tooltip=Mounts and vehicles go through nether and end portals with their riders (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.pearlsAcrossDimensions.tooltip=An ender pearl thrown through a portal teleports its thrower to the other dimension (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.pearlsLoadChunks.tooltip=Thrown ender pearls load and tick the 3x3 chunks around them, and leave with their thrower when they log out (1.21.2).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.tntThroughPortals.tooltip=Primed TNT goes through nether portals, and cannot break portal blocks afterwards (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.portalCooldowns.tooltip=Portal cooldowns: 0.5 seconds for boats and minecarts, 0.1 seconds for projectiles, a rider's own for a ridden mount (1.21.2).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.saddleRecipe.tooltip=Saddles are crafted from 3 leather and an iron ingot (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.saddleLoot.tooltip=Dungeon, temple and stronghold chests have 1-5 leather where they had a saddle (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.shearsRemoveEquipment.tooltip=Shears take off a mob's leads, then its horse armor or carpet, then its saddle, when no one rides it (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.horsesEatCarrots.tooltip=Horses, donkeys and mules eat carrots, as they eat apples (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.leads.tooltip=Sneak-use a mob to tie the mobs you lead to it; leads snap at 12 blocks instead of 10 (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.leadRecipe.tooltip=Leads are crafted from 5 string, without a slimeball (1.21.6).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.projectileKnockback.tooltip=Projectiles knock back in the direction they fly (potions away from themselves), and projectiles from dispensers knock back too (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.axeShield.tooltip=With an axe in the main hand and a shield in the off hand, use raises the shield (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.witchRedstone.tooltip=Witches always drop 4-8 redstone dust (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.noSpawnChunks.tooltip=No spawn chunks: the area around the world spawn is not kept loaded nor prepared at start (1.21.9). With Trails & Tales, its spawn chunk radius is set to 0.
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.noSpawnInvulnerability.tooltip=Players get no damage immunity when they spawn, respawn or join (1.21.4).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.waterBreathingRefillsAir.tooltip=Water Breathing and Conduit Power refill air under water (1.21.4).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.elytraEndsSprint.tooltip=Gliding with an elytra ends sprinting (1.21.4).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.elytraClimbables.tooltip=Gliding into a ladder or other climbable block ends the flight; vines can be glided through (1.21.5, 1.21.11).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.protectionStacks.tooltip=Fire Protection's shorter burning and Blast Protection's lower knockback add up over every piece worn (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.panic.tooltip=Animals panic for 2 seconds after damage that causes panic, not after any hit; adult polar bears only from fire, cactus and lightning; mounts ridden by mobs never (1.21, 1.21.11).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.crystalsFireImmune.tooltip=End crystals are immune to fire (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.mixedDoubleDoors.tooltip=Doors of different materials placed side by side form a double door (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.splashDistance.tooltip=A splash potion's strength depends on the distance from where it lands to the nearest part of a mob, not to its feet (1.21.2).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.pumpkinHidesMapMarker.tooltip=A pumpkin worn on the head hides you from other players' maps (1.21.2).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.toolFreeDrops.tooltip=Iron doors, pressure plates, brewing stands, ender chests, bells and lanterns drop when broken without the right tool (1.21.4).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.saddleThorns.tooltip=Thorns on a saddle hurts whoever attacks the mob wearing it (1.21.5).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.portalsDropBlocks.tooltip=The End's obsidian platform drops the blocks it replaces instead of deleting them (1.21).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.fireNearPlayers.tooltip=Fire only burns and spreads within 128 blocks of a player, unless the game rule allowFireTicksAwayFromPlayer is true (1.21.5).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.headNames.tooltip=A mob head keeps its custom name when placed and mined again (1.21.9).
config.trickytrialsbackport.tweaks.gameRules.tooltip=The game rules of 1.21.5 and 1.21.9: tntExplodes, allowFireTicksAwayFromPlayer, allowEnteringNetherUsingPortals, spawnMonsters, pvp, commandBlocksEnabled, spawnerBlocksEnabled.
